- matplotlib (Matplotlib License, BSD-compatible) draws the charts.
- matplotlib-fontja (MIT; Copyright (c) 2018 uehara, (c) 2024 ciffelia) ships
  the IPAexGothic font, which is used when no Japanese system font is
